I’m pulling together a quick outreach brief for a student in San Diego and could use some help tracking down a few specifics from official sources.

Could you find:
- the Lewis & Clark admissions counselor/rep for San Diego, including their contact details;
- Hunter College Silberman’s Fall 2026 MSW application deadline;
- the full list of graduate programs at Indiana University Kokomo;
- at least two currently recruiting glioblastoma clinical trials in Northern California through UCSF, with the study locations and recruiting status;
- the current director of student activities at Oral Roberts University and any official contact information listed; and
- whether EDF Energy says anything on its graduate programme page about salary reviews for new hires—ideally with the exact wording.

Please use the actual institutional or program pages rather than third-party listings, and send it back as a compact, linked summary so I can verify each item.
